    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87516" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προθετικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόθεσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>setting before itself,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀρετὴ π. [τοῦ τέλους</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>MM</u>
				1190a19
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιητικός,</span>
			<i>connected with planning,</i> opp. execution, prob.l. ib.<i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>for prefixing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μόριον</span>”
				<i>preposition,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Amm.</u>
					2.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>prepositional,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνδεσμοι</span> Stoic. ap. <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				305.24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύνταεις</span> A.d.l.c.<i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>.</div>
